# W31h, host a (k10): hosts Dry Land; with c onto stag0201's matz01 (the owner waits for two on the mat) into dng204b1:
# a and c are one sealed stage group there, where the relay's test hook makes a 40 s shared scene (TEST busy) right
# after b's GO is stamped.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log a hosts Dry Land
idle until present=3,sealed>=300 or epoch>=@420 fail stagechange
log b and c joined
explore matz01 yes 2 until stage=dng204b1,control fail epoch>=@800
log a and c in dng204b1
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=600
idle until epoch>=@1150
log a done
